Ques 1. Create a multi-section resume page using only HTML.
Include:
● <header> → Name & contact info
● <nav> → Quick links (About, Skills, Projects, Education)
● <main> →
○ <section> About Me
○ <section> Skills (unordered list)
○ <section> Projects (ordered list)
○ <section> Education (table format with course, institute, year)
● <footer> → Copyright info.

Ans 1. <!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Resume</title>
</head>
<body>

<header>
    <h1>Keshav</h1>
    <p>Email: keshav@example.com | Phone: +91 9876543210</p>
</header>

<nav>
    <a href="#about">About</a> |
    <a href="#skills">Skills</a> |
    <a href="#projects">Projects</a> |
    <a href="#education">Education</a>
</nav>

<main>

<section id="about">
    <h2>About Me</h2>
    <p>I am a B.Tech student interested in web development and programming.</p>
</section>

<section id="skills">
    <h2>Skills</h2>
    <ul>
        <li>HTML</li>
        <li>CSS</li>
        <li>Java</li>
        <li>JavaScript</li>
    </ul>
</section>

<section id="projects">
    <h2>Projects</h2>
    <ol>
        <li>Portfolio Website</li>
        <li>Student Management System</li>
        <li>Online Shopping Website</li>
    </ol>
</section>

<section id="education">
    <h2>Education</h2>
    <table border="1">
        <tr>
            <th>Course</th>
            <th>Institute</th>
            <th>Year</th>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td>B.Tech</td>
            <td>GLA University</td>
            <td>2027</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td>12th</td>
            <td>ABC School</td>
            <td>2023</td>
        </tr>
    </table>
</section>

</main>

<footer>
    <p>&copy; 2026 Keshav. All Rights Reserved.</p>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
